# The preinstalled Google Camera is not versioned: two APKs of other people's
# proprietary builds (about 300 MB) and the camera's JNI libraries unpacked from
# one of them. fetch-gcam.sh puts them here from meizu-fleet/artifacts/gcam,
# checked against the sha256 it pins, and .fetched is its stamp that all of it
# checked out.
*.apk
/lib/
/.fetched
